  "description": "Global unhandled exception handling for ASP.NET Core. A Roslyn source generator produces a compile-time dispatch table from exception types marked with [ProblemMapping], mapping them to RFC 7807 ProblemDetails responses with no runtime reflection.",
  "id": "CoreDesign.ExceptionHandling",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-13T12:47:58.57Z",
