  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.0.1\n- An unmapped BadHttpRequestException (for example a route value that cannot be bound) now keeps its own status code, typically 400, instead of becoming a 500. Its message appears in detail only in Development. A [ProblemMapping] for it still takes precedence.\n- The source generator builds against Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp 5.9.0 and needs a .NET SDK whose compiler is Roslyn 5.9 or later, such as 10.0.404.\n\n1.0.0\n- Initial release",
